 "system": {
  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Boogie Woogie — Cursed Technique Reversal</em></p><p>With great mastery over the Reversed Cursed Technique, you have found the reversal of your technique. Instead of switching your targets, you immobilize them for a short period, it's extremely simple but effective. You can immobilize yourself and 2 other creatures, cursed objects or tools within 60 ft of you for 2 cursed energy. All of the chosen creatures (including you) are stunned until the beginning of your next turn. You can use this technique as an action, bonus action, or reaction, however, it cannot benefit from additional reactions. After the first time this technique was used, any of the creatures affected can roll a CE saving throw at the end of their turns to end the effects.</p>",
   "chat": ""
  },
